          "kind": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    "5": {
      "note": "The bridge carries the review-presenter confinement and its two commands: a launch whose `ar.capability` is `review-presenter` is refused with `presenter_confinement_unavailable` unless the provider is Claude and the only applied tool server is `review-presenter`, and it then passes `tools: ''` with `strict-mcp-config` so the capability's own read/write tools are the entire authority on every resume; `presenter-transcript` and `presenter-cancel` are the bridge's own operations for reading an attempt's conversation and cancelling it. \\[5]",
      "targets": [
        {
          "anchor": {
